@host = http://localhost:5213
@adminKey = local-development-key-change-before-use
@adminEmail = admin@example.com
@adminPassword = Replace-With-A-Strong-Password-123!

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Published news
GET {{host}}/api/news?lang=ru&page=1&pageSize=12

### Latest news for the home page
GET {{host}}/api/news/latest?lang=ru&take=3

### Submit a contact message
POST {{host}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Иван",
  "email": "ivan@example.com",
  "message": "Хочу предложить сотрудничество с фондом Sabat.",
  "language": "ru",
  "website": ""
}

### Admin: contact messages
GET {{host}}/api/admin/contacts?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Admin: create the first account (works only while the table is empty)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/auth/bootstrap
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "displayName": "Sabat administrator",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Admin: login (the client stores the returned cookies)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Admin: all news
GET {{host}}/api/admin/news?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
